  "historyNote": "#5399, eff 5-21-92; ss and moved by #6750, eff 5-19-98 (from Rev 702.10); ss by #8653, eff 6-8-06 (formerly Rev 702.12); ss by #10714, eff 11-7-14 (formerly Rev 702.18); ss by #13077, eff 7-25-20; ss by #14105, eff 10-29-24, EXPIRES: 10-29-34 (formerly Rev 702.13)",
